# Erode: the search is not conditional on the destruction ("Destroy target creature or planeswalker. Its controller may
# search..."). Bot2 regenerates its Llanowar Elves with Yavimaya Hollow in response: the Elves are tapped and stay, and
# Bot2 is still asked and fetches a Swamp, tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Erode
Plains x5
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Yavimaya Hollow
Forest x4
Forest x3
Swamp
Forest x9

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Yavimaya Hollow.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Erode.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Yavimaya Hollow.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Regenerate)
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Search(Swamp)

